{
  "file": "module6",
  "page": 39,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        73.20639038085938,
        467.5744934082031,
        87.62739562988281
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 13: TB treatment for people living with HIV and histoplasmosis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.38239288330078,
        527.40234375,
        101.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "Histoplasmosis is highly endemic in some parts of the WHO Region of the Americas and is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.38239288330078,
        527.4183959960938,
        115.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "also reported in certain countries of Asia and Africa  . Co-occurrence can lead to complex  (20)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.38239288330078,
        527.4002075195312,
        129.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "management, with drug-drug interactions that may affect HIV, TB, and histoplasmosis treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.3824005126953,
        527.3927001953125,
        143.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": ". In particular, rifampicin results in reduced itraconazole levels, potentially leading to ineffective  (41)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.3824005126953,
        226.47470092773438,
        157.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "treatment for histoplasmosis  . (42)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.3824005126953,
        527.4166870117188,
        185.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review that informed the development of the Pan American Health Organization",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.3824005126953,
        527.419921875,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "(PAHO) and WHO  Guidelines for diagnosing and managing disseminated histoplasmosis among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3824005126953,
        527.412109375,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "found two studies (including one case report) reporting on treatment  people living with HIV (20)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.3824005126953,
        527.4265747070312,
        227.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "outcomes among people living with HIV, histoplasmosis and TB  . This recommendation  (42, 43)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.3824005126953,
        527.4367065429688,
        241.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "therefore relies on the expertise of the GDG and considers existing guidance on managing HIV and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.3824005126953,
        527.4334106445312,
        255.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "TB disease. The recommendation balances the risk for acquisition of TB drug resistance and the risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.41455078125,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "of drug-drug interactions (rifampicin and itraconazole), leading to subtherapeutic itraconazole levels",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.38238525390625,
        315.8558654785156,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "and potential ineffective treatment for histoplasmosis.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.38238525390625,
        527.4190673828125,
        311.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "When histoplasmosis is not controlled because of interactions between rifampicin and itraconazole,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.38238525390625,
        527.4212036132812,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "clinicians may consider, depending on local context, extending the duration of amphotericin B",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.3824157714844,
        527.4190673828125,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "induction therapy, once-weekly courses of amphotericin B, increasing the itraconazole dose and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.4146118164062,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "monitoring the blood level and toxicity and considering using other azole drugs (osaconazole,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.4169921875,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "voriconazole, or fluconazole). Finally, clinicians can consider replacing rifampicin with rifabutin.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.3824157714844,
        527.42236328125,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Treatment may need to be revised for people experiencing toxicity, drug-drug interactions, or for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.4102172851562,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "those with resistance profiles requiring protease inhibitors or second-line TB drugs. When possible,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        527.3850708007812,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "antiretroviral resistance genotyping and TB drug susceptibility testing may assist clinical decisions.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.3824157714844,
        382.9140625,
        423.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Itraconazole serum level testing may not be available in some areas.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.2064208984375,
        390.6745300292969,
        451.6274108886719
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 14: Providing TB treatment in HIV care settings",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        527.4190063476562,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review evaluating the effectiveness of delivering ART in TB treatment settings identified",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.3824157714844,
        527.3883056640625,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "19 observational studies, many of which showed increased uptake and timeliness of ART initiation.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.3824157714844,
        527.4376831054688,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "However, the data on mortality and TB treatment success were inconsistent. The same systematic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        527.4257202148438,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "review identified five observational studies evaluating the effectiveness of delivering TB treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.4310302734375,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "in HIV care settings. Two studies reported decreased mortality and another showed comparable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.3824462890625,
        524.4075927734375,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "mortality rates. The TB treatment success rates and ART uptake were comparable across studies  . (44)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        329.7992858886719,
        801.2599487304688,
        553.4072875976562,
        811.8897705078125
      ],
      "text": "21 2. ﻿ Reduce the burden of TB among people living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}